      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. More specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the **environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** (or Query agent process)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated \u2014 the credential is kept entirely out of the Hub process itself\n\nThe design ensures that if the Hub process were compromised or misbehaving, it could not leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables, since the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
